#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.rolling.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.rolling"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.rolling:1 of
msgid "Provide rolling-window calculations."
msgstr "提供滚动窗口计算。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.rolling:3 of
msgid ""
"Returns a :class:`LiteFrameRolling` object whose aggregation methods "
"(``.sum()``, ``.mean()``, ...) compute a fixed-size moving window "
"aggregation. Only integer window sizes are supported."
msgstr ""
"返回一个 :class:`LiteFrameRolling` 对象，其聚合方法（``.sum()``、``.mean("
")`` 等）计算固定大小的移动窗口聚合。仅支持整数窗口大小。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.rolling.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.rolling:7 of
msgid "Size of the moving window (number of rows). Must be positive."
msgstr "移动窗口的大小（行数）。必须为正数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.rolling:9 of
msgid ""
"Minimum number of observations in a window required to produce a value ("
"otherwise null). Defaults to ``window`` (matching pandas). For ``count`` "
"the value is the number of non-null observations, but ``min_periods`` "
"still gates on the number of window rows (observations), not the non-null"
" count — consistent with pandas."
msgstr ""
"窗口中生成值所需的最小观测数量（否则为null）。默认为 ``window`` （与"
"pandas匹配）。对于 ``count``，值是非空观测的数量，但 ``min_periods`` 仍然"
"基于窗口行数（观测数），而不是非空计数——与pandas一致。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.rolling:15 of
msgid "Center the window on the current row."
msgstr "将窗口居中于当前行。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.rolling:17 of
msgid ""
"Column(s) to aggregate. If None, all columns are aggregated. Non-selected"
" columns are passed through unchanged."
msgstr "要聚合的列。如果为None，则聚合所有列。未选择的列保持不变通过。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.rolling:20 of
msgid ""
"Column(s) that define the order in which the window expands (equivalent "
"to ``ORDER BY`` inside a MaxCompute ``OVER()`` clause). The output row "
"order is unchanged; each row receives the aggregation computed over the "
"rows that precede it in *order_by* order."
msgstr ""
"定义窗口扩展顺序的列（相当于MaxCompute ``OVER()`` 子句内的 ``ORDER BY``）"
"。输出行顺序保持不变；每行接收在 *order_by* 顺序中先于它的行上计算的聚合"
"。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.rolling:25 of
msgid ""
"Sort direction for each *order_by* column. A single bool is broadcast to "
"all columns."
msgstr "每个 *order_by* 列的排序方向。单个布尔值广播到所有列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.rolling:28 of
msgid ""
"Offset the window frame by N rows. A positive value shifts the window "
"forward (toward later rows), a negative value backward. Matches the "
"MaxCompute ``shift`` MF-specific window parameter."
msgstr ""
"将窗口框架偏移N行。正值将窗口向前移动（朝向后面的行），负值向后移动。匹配"
"MaxCompute ``shift`` MF特定窗口参数。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.rolling.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.rolling:33 of
msgid "Intermediate object; call an aggregation method to produce a LiteFrame."
msgstr "中间对象；调用聚合方法以生成LiteFrame。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.rolling.rst
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.rolling.rst
msgid "抛出"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.rolling:36 of
msgid ""
"If ``window`` is not an integer (offset/time windows unsupported),     or"
" if MF-specific fields (``order_by``/``window_shift``) are used with     "
"grouped or multi-chunk inputs."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``window`` 不是整数（不支持偏移/时间窗口），或如果MF特定字段（``"
"order_by``/``window_shift``）与分组或多块输入一起使用。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.rolling:37 of
msgid "If ``window`` is not positive or ``min_periods`` is invalid."
msgstr "如果 ``window`` 不为正数或 ``min_periods`` 无效。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.rolling:41 of
msgid ":py:obj:`expanding`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.rolling:42 of
msgid "Provide expanding window calculations."
msgstr "提供扩展窗口计算。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.rolling:44 of
msgid ":py:obj:`shift`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.rolling.rolling:45 of
msgid "Shift rows by a given number of periods."
msgstr "按给定的周期数移动行。"

